#. rich_text: <i>"However, the Blocker can deliver an infinite number of injections. Just needs a day to recharge between each dose."
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "\"However, the Blocker can deliver an infinite number of injections. Just needs a day to recharge between each dose.\""
msgstr ""

#. rich_text: <i>"However, the Blocker can deliver an infinite number of injections. Just needs to recharge between each dose."
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "\"However, the Blocker can deliver an infinite number of injections. Just needs to recharge between each dose.\""
msgstr ""

#. rich_text: <i>"I just... couldn't perfect the antidote, so it's temporary. It only heals Crush buildup... or in layman's terms... reverses arousal."
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "\"I just... couldn't perfect the antidote, so it's temporary. It only heals Crush buildup... or in layman's terms... reverses arousal.\""
msgstr ""

#. rich_text: <i>"I truly believed my work would make the world a better place. That if people were just <b>compelled</b> to cooperate together..."</i>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "\"I truly believed my work would make the world a better place. That if people were just compelled to cooperate together...\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "\"IA"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "\"III"
msgstr ""

#. rich_text: <i>"It worked... too well. The ramifications are horrifying. My coworkers are now discussing mass emission methods."</i>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "\"It worked... too well. The ramifications are horrifying. My coworkers are now discussing mass emission methods.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "\"It's not a toy, mom!!\" That sorta vibe.X"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "\"KA"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "\"MA"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "\"MA!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "\"Me\"... Hmm."
msgstr ""

#. rich_text: <i>"Now I'm sure you have many questions... like "What even is Peitho?"-</i>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "\"Now I'm sure you have many questions... like \"What even is Peitho?\"-"
msgstr ""

#. rich_text: <i>"So... I've created an antidote. The 'Crush Blocker' in this suitcase should innoculate someone against my poison."</i>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "\"So... I've created an antidote. The 'Crush Blocker' in this suitcase should innoculate someone against my poison.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "speaker:Klaudia"
msgid "\"Sorry\" won't cut it! Come with me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "\"That's a good girl.\" But your voice trails off as you drift in for a kiss."
msgstr ""

#. rich_text: <i>"This is Dr. Lozenge. Lead Scientist of Project Crush in the R&D Department of Peitho..."
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "\"This is Dr. Lozenge. Lead Scientist of Project Crush in the R&D Department of Peitho...\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "\"This one\"? That is a curious speech pattern they gave you..."
msgstr ""

#. rich_text: <i>"To use the blocker, first give it a squeeze to release the protrusion plug. Then inject it into your neck port."</i>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "\"To use the blocker, first give it a squeeze to release the protrusion plug. Then inject it into your neck port.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "\"WA"
msgstr ""

#. rich_text: <i>"We recently conducted a successful test of Crush Waves... a true method of mind control... with a side effect of arousal."</i>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "\"We recently conducted a successful test of Crush Waves... a true method of mind control... with a side effect of arousal.\""
msgstr ""

#. rich_text: <i>"Well... time has shown me just how wrong I was. I just hope the world doesn't need to suffer because of my mistakes."</i>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "\"Well... time has shown me just how wrong I was. I just hope the world doesn't need to suffer because of my mistakes.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "\"What if something happened to her\" You were going to say before getting cut off. You're really worried about your cat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "\"ZA"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "\"ZI"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "\"because of you.\" You blame Zoey for what happened."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "\"can't imagine what I'd do without her.\" You're very anxious about finding your lost cat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "\"enjoy your meal!\" \"you too!\" instant suffering..."
msgstr ""

