msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Just for a quick moment... Okay...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Just forget I said that, my sweet sapphic sapphire."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Just fuckin' with ya. I get it, super spy! You've got your merc work. I'll swing by your place in a bit-"
msgstr ""

