msgid "Like I know!? What's this thing doing, Z?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Like I said, I have my ways. Now feel free to look around. We're not quite ready for business yet, but once we are, you'll know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Like I'm going to miss this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Like before, you should stimulate this ones self-lubrication system. That should facilitate the insertion."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Like saying 'nice doggy' when it's growling at you"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Like that cat of yours. Should probably have kept a closer eye on it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Like that over there! But wait... that's not it."
msgstr ""

