msgid "Like this...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Like trying to tell your parents you did something bad but don't wanna say it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Like what you see, huh~?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "speaker:Bunnygirl"
msgid "Like what you see?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Like what you're doing for me. Wish I could return the favour... but it's like I'm barely treading water."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Like you're calling a pet."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Like you're talking to your cat.?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Like, yeah, I'm bummed we aren't gonna be roommates, but I'm not just gonna leave you with nothing."
msgstr ""

