msgid "Quite bold of you to bring it back here after you worked so hard to take it from that suitcase, merc."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "speaker:Klaudia"
msgid "Quite the body you got there, thief. Not even any chrome on it. Customers will love you, ehehe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "speaker:Leona"
msgid "Quite. Not that it matters anymore. Moving here has lead me to meeting you darling, so maybe it was worth it in the end, ehehe."
msgstr ""

